{"id":"58d8bff43d6d4102","group":"93","path":"93/93-df-monomorphism.md","title":"Monomorphism","display":"df-monomorphism — Monomorphism","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-df-monomorphism","aliases":["93-df-monomorphism"],"display":"df-monomorphism — Monomorphism","depends_on":["[[93-df-category]]","[[93-df-morphism]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-df-monomorphism"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-df-monomorphism</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-monomorphism — Monomorphism"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"aa74a8aadef06b6c\" href=\"?note=aa74a8aadef06b6c\" title=\"93-df-category\">93-df-category</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\">\\(\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}\\)</span> (the typed morphism predicate of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b3500ab2f8429ba4\" href=\"?note=b3500ab2f8429ba4\" title=\"93-df-morphism\">93-df-morphism</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\">\\(\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}\\)</span> (the monomorphism predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}s\\to r=s\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}s\\to r=s\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Monomorphisms are precisely the arrows that are left-cancellable against every parallel pair in the same category.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-category","status":"resolved","id":"aa74a8aadef06b6c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-category]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-morphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-morphism","status":"resolved","id":"b3500ab2f8429ba4","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ (the typed morphism predicate of [[93-df-morphism]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}monomorphism}\\vdash \\mathrm{Mono}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Cat}_{93}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}(m,A,B,\\mathcal C)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall X\\in\\mathrm{Obj}_{\\mathcal C}\\;\\forall r,s\\in\\mathrm{Hom}_{\\mathcal C}(X,A)\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl(m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}r=m\\circ_{\\mathcal C}s\\to r=s\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1009,"backlinks":[{"id":"610e35470f5c7f53","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ (the monomorphism predicate of [[93-df-monomorphism]])"},{"id":"8311ab8098e68fa0","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Mor}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ (see [[93-df-morphism]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]])"},{"id":"dbf8e12e31001be4","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Finite}_{93}$ and $\\mathrm{Mono}_{93}$ are the finite-set and monomorphism predicates of [[93-df-finite-subset]] and [[93-df-monomorphism]]."}],"outgoing":["aa74a8aadef06b6c","b3500ab2f8429ba4"]}